  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Local Authorities and their associations at national regional and global level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Action intends to contribute to the MIP GC &#xbf; priority area 4: partnership: local authorities, SO3: Strengthened local authorities at global level and the Africa RIP. As policy-making and implementing actors of development, the EU will seek to increase the institutional and operational capacity of local authorities&#xbf; associations and their members to enable them to play their role in favour of enhanced governance and more effective development outcomes at the local level SDG 11 and 17 and, indirectly, most of all the other SDGs given the scope of the mandate of LAs (SDGs 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10, 13, and 16).</narrative>
  </description>
